'''Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's''' (お祭りにゃんこ ～春節編～, ''O Matsuri Nyanko ～Shunsetsuhen～'', '''Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's''') is an event added in the [[Version 11.2 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's will reset when the event ends. The featured enemy of this Gauntlet is the [[Firecracker]].

==Overview==
===About===
Festival Cats: Lunar New Year's contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion is a Legendary Lucky Charm.

